00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,550
I'll teleport you in the void

281
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:00,870
with no way back

282
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:02,390
and nowhere to go.

283
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,150
You will live in constant fear

284
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:07,750
until you die miserably !

285
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,120
Formation, activate !

286
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,550
This jade slip

287
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:17,150
details how to counter the Giant Demon Clan's teleportation spell.

288
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:21,910
How ?!

289
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:24,950
I can't stop your bloodline power,

290
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:27,990
but if I can find my way back,

291
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:29,550
then it's useless.

292
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,270
An Orientation Formation...

293
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,350
You...

294
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:34,790
are already dead.

295
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,390
This is impossible...

296
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:51,590
This is impossible !!!

297
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:01,190
Zhuque Zi will likely soon learn

298
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:03,870
of the deaths of the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor and Li Yuanfeng.

299
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:07,390
But there are more pressing matters now.

300
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:10,080
It's nearly been

301
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,790
18 years.

302
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,920
Law of the heavens...

303
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:16,910
Once again,

304
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:21,590
I will take Wan'er back from you !

305
00:19:42,290 --> 00:19:45,590
To let go of the consequences of my actions

306
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:47,310
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

307
00:19:47,350 --> 00:19:49,250
like scattered ink.

308
00:19:50,130 --> 00:19:56,730
As destiny falls

309
00:19:52,970 --> 00:19:56,730
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

310
00:19:56,730 --> 00:20:04,330
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

311
00:19:59,970 --> 00:20:04,330
wither and melt into rivers.

312
00:20:04,770 --> 00:20:11,890
Who can deceive

313
00:20:07,530 --> 00:20:11,890
the law of the heavens ?

314
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:15,210
Countless generations

315
00:20:13,490 --> 00:20:15,210
have tried before me.

316
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:18,930
But how could I not catch my dreams

317
00:20:17,330 --> 00:20:18,930
within my warm fingers ?

318
00:20:19,490 --> 00:20:23,010
You're at my side when I'm alone

319
00:20:23,010 --> 00:20:26,330
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

320
00:20:27,090 --> 00:20:30,290
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

321
00:20:30,650 --> 00:20:34,490
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

322
00:20:32,490 --> 00:20:34,490
in the streets.

323
00:20:34,650 --> 00:20:39,450
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

324
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:39,450
Can I break the rules ?

325
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:42,170
To run towards you !

326
00:20:42,210 --> 00:20:45,490
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

327
00:20:45,490 --> 00:20:50,130
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

328
00:20:50,130 --> 00:20:53,530
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

329
00:20:53,570 --> 00:20:58,210
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

330
00:20:58,660 --> 00:21:03,890
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

331
00:21:04,010 --> 00:21:07,810
If your soul is willing to wander,

332
00:21:07,810 --> 00:21:12,450
can I still take your hands

333
00:21:09,490 --> 00:21:12,450
and hold them tight ?

334
00:21:12,610 --> 00:21:15,530
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

335
00:21:15,530 --> 00:21:20,410
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

336
00:21:20,420 --> 00:21:23,690
I dream of destroying

337
00:21:23,850 --> 00:21:28,410
the shackles of our fate.

338
00:21:28,410 --> 00:21:32,370
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

339
00:21:32,370 --> 00:21:35,170
You're the hardest to let go of.

340
00:21:35,250 --> 00:21:39,050
I want to be with you again

341
00:21:39,130 --> 00:21:42,410
so I can look in your eyes.

342
00:21:42,690 --> 00:21:47,650
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
